        "selector": {
          "type": "FragmentSelector",
          "value": "xywh=pixel:154.26756286621094,1965.5079345703125,3209.679702758789,2600.9080810546875",
          "conformsTo": "http://www.w3.org/TR/media-frags/"
        }
      },
      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "Recto, main text",
          "value": "\n<ol><li>\n<p>My petition to the noble dust under the feet of his excellency is as follows:</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>There are places that produce income for al-Khad\u0323ra muqa\u0304t\u0323a\u02bfa. Various ka\u0304shifs\u2019 men and other people come from everywhere</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>to this region and take the sheep and other objects that be- long to the state,</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>and in addition to taking them, they even say of the peasants\u2019 sheep and possessions, \u2018They are ours\u2019, and in this way</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>they make off with the ma\u0304l-i mi\u0304ri\u0304. When we ask them why</p>\n<p>they are doing this, some pull out a mace, some a sword,</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>and cause harm to the ma\u0304l-i mi\u0304ri\u0304. From my lord is requested a definitive noble decree, confirming that no one from among these [people] may obstruct the ma\u0304l-i mi\u0304ri\u0304,</p>\n</li>\n\n\n<li>\n<p>that they may not pull a sword or mace on us, and that they must not prevent us from taking the property that belongs to us, </p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>[so] that the ma\u0304l-i mi\u0304ri\u0304 is collected and not harmed, </p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>and that no one who has ma\u0304l-i mi\u0304ri\u0304 in his possession, whoever he may be, shall contravene the [sacred] law.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>The eternal command is my lord\u2019s. </p>\n</li></ol>\n\n",
          "format": "text/html"
        }
      ],
      "motivation": [
        "sc:supplementing",
        "translating"
      ],
      "schema:position": 1
    },
